<title>USA: Sybron closes National Scientific purchase.</title>
<headline>Sybron closes National Scientific purchase.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sybron International Corp said it completed acquisition of National Scientific Co, an Atlanta, Ga.-based company which supplies equipment to laboratories and has sales of about $10 million.</p>
<p>Sybron said it issued shares of its common stock in the acquisition. The transaction will be accounted for as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>Shares of Sybron were trading up 1/8 to 35-1/8.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
